    404  f1bf							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    405  f1bf							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    406  f1bf							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
