    872  f584							; --- Respawn hover (user rule 2026-10-21) ------------------------------
    873  f584							; $FF = armed at death (kernel LoseLife): an untouched player keeps
    874  f584							; hovering. The FIRST direction/fire press starts the 1.5 s grace, which
    875  f584							; then expires on its own so a sideways-only player still falls. Frozen
    876  f584							; while a drop-in/title/tally owns the player (DropTarget != 0) — otherwise
    877  f584							; the grace expires before he lands and the water death repeats.
    878  f584							; Runs on the FIRST TopGap line only: the next WSYNC absorbs its variable
    879  f584							; cycles, so the HUD band's line count and its cycle-tuned lines never move.
