    902  f5a7							; ====================================================================
    903  f5a7							; Line 1: Timer bar — PF body, mid-scanline COLUPF yellow→red
    904  f5a7							; Full (BarLevel >= BAR_MAX-7 = 113..120): pure yellow, no red write.
    905  f5a7							; The 8-dec hold (bugs.md #30, 2026-10-11) delays the FIRST red until
    906  f5a7							; t=8s = exactly one chunk period (K=8), so the first red appears on
    907  f5a7							; the same cadence as every later chunk. Chunks are 3-4c (9-12px) so
    908  f5a7							; the bite (14px incl. the F4 top-block render offset) is ~1.2x a
    909  f5a7							; chunk instead of the reported 5-6x.
    910  f5a7							; H3c dual path: F=0 slim / F=1 slim+nop / F=2,3,4 full dispatch.
    911  f5a7							; dispatch ≤73c from the TopGap WSYNC to the first bar WSYNC.
