   1321  f7eb							; ====================================================================
   1322  f7eb							; Pad remaining scanlines to reach exactly 48 total
   1323  f7eb							; Path A (PlayerLives > 0) — execution count:
   1324  f7eb							;   Top gap:  6 (4 + 2 former ball-pos lines — elements keep lines)
   1325  f7eb							;   Timer:    3 loop + 1 gap = 4
   1326  f7eb							;   Lives:    2 SetObjectXPos (P0 lives, P1 key) + 1 HMOVE + 5 render
   1327  f7eb							;	       + 1 gap = 9
   1328  f7eb							;   Bombs:    3 SetObjectXPos (P0, P1 miners, M0 5th bomb) + 1 HMOVE
   1329  f7eb							;	       + 5 render + 3 gap = 12 (2026-10-26: +1 line, pad 8 -> 7)
   1330  f7eb							;   Score:    2 SetObjectXPos + 1 HMOVE + 7 ScoreLoop = 10
   1331  f7eb							;   Subtotal: 6+4+9+12+10 = 41
   1332  f7eb							;   Pad:      48 - 41 = 7
   1333  f7eb							; Both lives paths run the same instructions (GRP0/GRP1 just stay 0),
   1334  f7eb							; so the band is 48 lines for every lives count and every key state.
   1335  f7eb							; ====================================================================
