   1795  fabb							; (PairGone RETIRED, plan 5.1b 2026-10-20: the cell punch guards a repeat
   1796  fabb							;  blast on the PF buffer itself — the punched cell pair is empty, so a
   1797  fabb							;  second blast in the same room cannot score again. No rect idx4, no mask.)
