   2112  fcc3							; Bit masks for IsRoomDark/SetRoomDark. Index 4+room for EnemyRamD
   2113  fcc3							; (rooms 0-3 → bits 4-7); index = room for LaserState (rooms 4-7 →
   2114  fcc3							; bits 4-7 of the table, lsr×2 down to bits 2-5 = LaserState spare).
